      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无数选手在比赛中战作一团、激烈角逐——\r\n在最终直线上，十一号选手奋然冲出重围。\r\n十一号好歌剧以鼻差优势夺冠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb3ae2edb4318ce84cfee8ec9355226b076b6dfba64091ecd9fed218bb2727db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
