      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而她命中注定的劲敌・名将怒涛则是第二名。\r\n整个会场都因这位歌剧之王宛若执念般的奔跑而\r\n沸腾起来——",
      "source_fingerprint": "66e5bca6267626e54dfc3df20403fb209c51c2741db4662c7d0aac1929d4afe2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
